</b></font>

222
00:22:50,740 --> 00:22:53,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>With the Sharingan in my right eye,
and the Rinnegan in my left…

</b></font>

223
00:22:53,860 --> 00:22:55,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What future will
these eyes see now?
 
</b></font>

224
00:22:55,990 --> 00:22:57,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>These eyes that once
only saw darkness?
 
</b></font>

225
